   "type": "table",
   "headers": [
    "Sentence",
    "Romanized",
    "Meaning"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "भोलि पानी **पर्न सक्छ**।",
     "bholi pānī parna sakcha",
     "It might rain tomorrow"
